{%- comment -%}
  mahekh.in v2 (Claude, 19 Nov 2026, owner request): copy of the checkout live on ayushadivasi.in (red shake COD button,
  Releasit-style popup, blur loader, D1 step tracking) with mahekh's settings and Pay Online (PayU) kept visible.
  The PayU flow (/prepaid/start → PayU → /payu/return → success on the same page) is the same as mahekh's v1 (4 Nov).
  Previous live file (v1): backups/own_checkout_v2_nov19/live_158843044032_mahekh-own-checkout.before.liquid
  16 Nov 2026 (v2): popup restyled like the Releasit COD form (see cod_popup_redesign/). Order logic unchanged.
  Own checkout (same popup, styling and behaviour as the one live on mahekh.in since 4 Nov 2026; kit version 10 Nov 2026).
  Two buttons: Cash on Delivery popup + Pay Online (PayU).
  Save as snippets/own-checkout.liquid and render it OUTSIDE (right after) the product <form> / </product-form>:
    {% render 'own-checkout', product: product, form_id: product_form_id %}
  Server: set mhc_api below once the order server is live. Until then the popup runs in DEMO mode (no real order).
  Add ?mh_demo=1 to any product URL to force demo mode.
  Sizes are in rem with 1rem = 10px (Dawn-family themes set html{font-size:62.5%}). If this theme's root font is 16px,
  convert the <style> block rem → px (x10) first (install_theme.mjs --rem-to-px does it).
  Step tracking: GA4-only events, no visible change. Each fires once per popup opening:
  mhc_prefilled, mhc_f_<field> (field became valid), mhc_mode_cod/online, mhc_pack_change, mhc_submit_tap, mhc_err_<field>,
  mhc_err_server / mhc_err_network, mhc_payu_go, mhc_payu_back_ok / _fail, mhc_exit_<first missing field|ready> (closed),
  mhc_away_<first missing field|ready> (page hidden / app left while the popup was open).
  Abandoned checkout (20 Nov 2026, owner request): once the phone number is valid, the typed details go to <worker>/ab
  (4 s after the last change, on close, on leaving the page/app, before PayU). No visible change. The worker turns them into a
  Shopify DRAFT order tagged `abandoned-checkout` if no order came for that phone within 30 minutes.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS: change only these lines ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_api = 'https://mahekh-checkout.ratnakar-auto-dm.workers.dev' -%}{%- comment -%} worker URL from deploy.mjs, e.g. https://brand-checkout.xxxx.workers.dev — empty = DEMO mode {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_prepaid_off = 100 -%}{%- comment -%} rupees off for Pay Online; MUST equal PREPAID_OFF in wrangler.toml {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_min_addr = 10 -%}{%- comment -%} min letters for address; MUST equal MIN_ADDR in wrangler.toml {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_min_landmark = 5 -%}{%- comment -%} min letters for landmark (required again 18 Nov 2026); MUST equal MIN_LANDMARK in wrangler.toml {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_pixel_id = '596578329419010' -%}{%- comment -%} this store's Meta pixel id (same as PIXEL_ID in wrangler.toml) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_gads_send_to = 'AW-18555004443/CmsoCNH23bEdEJvM249F' -%}{%- comment -%} optional Google Ads conversion, e.g. AW-123456789/AbCdEf {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_brand_line = 'Mahekh · Kannauj' -%}{%- comment -%} small gold line above the product name in the popup, e.g. 'Brand · City' {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_delivery_days = '3–5 days' -%}{%- comment -%} shown on the success screen {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} ===== end of settings ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mhc_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

<div class="mhc" id="mhc-root" data-api="{{ mhc_api }}" data-form-id="{{ form_id }}">
  <div class="mhc-btns">
    {%- comment -%} 19 Nov 2026: same red shake button as ayushadivasi.in (owner request). Old brown button: backups/own_checkout_v2_nov19/ {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign mhc_jost600 = settings.type_body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '600' -%}
    {%- if mhc_jost600 and settings.type_body_font.family == 'Jost' -%}<style id="mhc-jost600">{{ mhc_jost600 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}</style>{%- endif -%}
    <style id="ay-rsi-btn">.mhc-btns .mhc-btn.mhc-btn--cod.ay-rsi{background:#f50e0e!important;color:#fff!important;border:0!important;border-radius:2px!important;box-shadow:0 2px 7px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1)!important;width:100%!important;min-height:51px!important;height:auto!important;padding:12px 20px 14px!important;margin:0!important;display:flex!important;flex-direction:row!important;justify-content:center!important;align-items:center!important;gap:0!important;font-family:Jost,sans-serif!important;font-size:16px!important;font-weight:600!important;line-height:1.3!important;letter-spacing:.6px!important;text-transform:none!important;text-align:center!important;text-shadow:none!important;overflow:visible!important;animation:ayRsiShake 3s cubic-bezier(.35,.06,.2,.98) infinite both!important}.mhc-btns .mhc-btn.mhc-btn--cod.ay-rsi .ay-rsi__ico{width:23px;height:23px;flex:none;margin:0 7px 0 0;fill:#fff}.mhc-btns .mhc-btn.mhc-btn--cod.ay-rsi span{font:inherit!important;letter-spacing:inherit!important;color:inherit!important}.mhc-btns .mhc-btn.mhc-btn--cod.ay-rsi[disabled]{animation:none!important}@keyframes ayRsiShake{0%,28.667%,100%{transform:scaleX(1)}2.867%,5.733%{transform:scale3d(.97,.97,.97) rotate(-1deg)}8.6%,14.333%,20.067%,25.8%{transform:scale3d(1.03,1.03,1.03) rotate(1deg)}11.467%,17.2%,22.933%{transform:scale3d(1.03,1.03,1.03) rotate(-1deg)}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mhc-btns .mhc-btn.mhc-btn--cod.ay-rsi{animation:none!important}}</style>
    <button type="button" class="mhc-btn mhc-btn--cod ay-rsi" data-mhc-open="cod" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><svg class="ay-rsi__ico" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0h24v24H0V0z" fill="none"/><path d="M15.55 13c.75 0 1.41-.41 1.75-1.03l3.58-6.49c.37-.66-.11-1.48-.87-1.48H5.21l-.94-2H1v2h2l3.6 7.59-1.35 2.44C4.52 15.37 5.48 17 7 17h12v-2H7l1.1-2h7.45zM6.16 6h12.15l-2.76 5H8.53L6.16 6zM7 18c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2S5.9 22 7 22s2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2zm10 0c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2s.89 2 1.99 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2z"/></svg><span>Order Now - Cash on Delivery</span></button>

    <button type="button" class="mhc-btn mhc-btn--pre{% if mhc_prepaid_off <= 0 %} mhc-btn--notag{% endif %}" data-mhc-open="prepaid" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
      <span class="mhc-btn__shine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {%- if mhc_prepaid_off > 0 -%}<span class="mhc-btn__tag">EXTRA ₹{{ mhc_prepaid_off }} OFF</span>{%- endif -%}
      <span class="mhc-btn__row">
        <svg class="mhc-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M3 10h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M7 14.5h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span class="mhc-btn__main">PAY ONLINE &middot; <span data-mhc-btnprice></span></span>
      </span>
      <span class="mhc-btn__sub">UPI &middot; Cards &middot; Netbanking{% if mhc_prepaid_off > 0 %} &middot; <s data-mhc-btnmrp></s>{% endif %}</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mhc-overlay" id="mhc-overlay" hidden>
  <div class="mhc-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mhc-title">

    <div class="mhc-top">
      <div class="mhc-head">
        <h2 class="mhc-head__title" id="mhc-title" data-mhc-title>CASH ON DELIVERY</h2>
        <button type="button" class="mhc-x" data-mhc-close aria-label="Close">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FORM VIEW (16 Nov 2026 layout): order line, totals, address fields, button at the end of the scroll -->
    <form class="mhc-main mhc-view" data-view="form" novalidate autocomplete="on">
      <div class="mhc-body">
        <div class="mhc-li">
          <div class="mhc-li__img">
            {%- if product.featured_media -%}<img src="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 160 }}" alt="" width="58" height="58" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
            <span class="mhc-li__qty">1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-li__info">
            <span class="mhc-li__title">{{ product.title | split: '–' | first | strip | escape }}</span>
            {%- if product.has_only_default_variant == false -%}<span class="mhc-li__var" data-mhc-li-var></span>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-li__price" data-mhc-li-price></div>
        </div>

        <div class="mhc-opts">
        {%- if product.has_only_default_variant == false -%}
          <p class="mhc-step" hidden>1. Choose your pack</p>
          <div class="mhc-chips" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose pack" hidden>
            {%- for v in product.variants -%}
              <button type="button" class="mhc-chip" role="radio" data-mhc-variant="{{ v.id }}" {% unless v.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                <span class="mhc-chip__t">{{ v.title | escape }}</span>
                <span class="mhc-chip__p"></span>
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <p class="mhc-step mhc-step--pay">How will you pay?</p>
        <div class="mhc-pay" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Payment method">
          <button type="button" class="mhc-pay__opt" role="radio" data-mhc-mode="cod">
            <span class="mhc-radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="mhc-pay__txt"><b>Cash on Delivery</b><small>Pay when it arrives</small></span>
            <span class="mhc-pay__amt" data-mhc-amt="cod"></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="mhc-pay__opt" role="radio" data-mhc-mode="prepaid">
            <span class="mhc-radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="mhc-pay__txt"><b>Pay Online</b><small>UPI / Cards{% if mhc_prepaid_off > 0 %} &middot; <em>Save ₹{{ mhc_prepaid_off }}</em>{% endif %}</small></span>
            <span class="mhc-pay__amt" data-mhc-amt="prepaid"></span>
          </button>
        </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mhc-sum">
          <div><span>Subtotal</span><span data-mhc-sum="mrp"></span></div>
          <div class="mhc-sum__off" data-mhc-sum-offrow hidden><span>Online payment discount</span><span>−₹{{ mhc_prepaid_off }}</span></div>
          <div><span>Shipping</span><span class="mhc-free">Free</span></div>
          <div class="mhc-sum__tot"><span>Total</span><span data-mhc-sum="total"></span></div>
        </div>

        <p class="mhc-addr-h">Enter your shipping address</p>
        <div class="mhc-fields">
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-name">Full name<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v1a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Full name" autocomplete="name" autocapitalize="words" enterkeyhint="next" maxlength="60" required>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-err">Please enter your full name</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-phone">Phone number<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.15 15.15 0 0 0 6.59 6.59l2.2-2.2a1 1 0 0 1 1.02-.24c1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57a1 1 0 0 1 1 1V20a1 1 0 0 1-1 1C10.61 21 3 13.39 3 4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1c0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57a1 1 0 0 1-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Phone" autocomplete="tel-national" enterkeyhint="next" maxlength="11" required>
              <span class="mhc-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-err">Enter a valid 10-digit mobile number</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-address">Address<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-address" name="address" type="text" placeholder="Address" autocomplete="street-address" enterkeyhint="next" maxlength="160" required>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-count" data-count="address">0/{{ mhc_min_addr }}</small>
            <small class="mhc-err">Please write your full address (at least {{ mhc_min_addr }} letters)</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-landmark">Landmark<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-landmark" name="landmark" type="text" placeholder="Nearby school, hospital, shop" enterkeyhint="next" maxlength="100" required>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-count" data-count="landmark">0/{{ mhc_min_landmark }}</small>
            <small class="mhc-err">Please write a nearby landmark (at least {{ mhc_min_landmark }} letters)</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f mhc-f--select">
            <label for="mhc-state">State<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw">
              <select class="mhc-in" id="mhc-state" name="state" autocomplete="address-level1" required>
                <option value="">State</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-err">Select your state</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-city">City<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-city" name="city" type="text" placeholder="City" autocomplete="address-level2" autocapitalize="words" enterkeyhint="next" maxlength="40" required>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-err">Enter city</small>
          </div>
          <div class="mhc-f">
            <label for="mhc-pin">Pincode<span class="mhc-req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3 8.6 21M15.4 3 14 21M4 8.5h17M3 15.5h17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-pin" name="pincode" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Pincode" autocomplete="postal-code" enterkeyhint="done" maxlength="6" required>
              <span class="mhc-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
            <small class="mhc-err">6-digit pincode</small>
          </div>
          <small class="mhc-pinok" hidden></small>
          <div class="mhc-f mhc-f--email" data-mhc-email hidden>
            <label for="mhc-email">Email for payment receipt (optional)</label>
            <div class="mhc-iw"><span class="mhc-ib" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2zm0 4-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/></svg></span>
              <input class="mhc-in" id="mhc-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" enterkeyhint="done" maxlength="80">
            </div>
          </div>
          <input type="text" name="company_website" class="mhc-hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        </div>

        <div class="mhc-foot">
          <p class="mhc-msg" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <button type="submit" class="mhc-submit">
            <span class="mhc-submit__shine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="mhc-submit__txt" data-mhc-cta></span>
            <span class="mhc-submit__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <!-- 16 Nov 2026: blur + loading bar while the order is being placed -->
    <div class="mhc-load" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
      <div class="mhc-load__card">
        <p class="mhc-load__t" data-mhc-load-t>Confirming your order…</p>
        <div class="mhc-load__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
        <p class="mhc-load__s">Please wait, do not close this page</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAYMENT REDIRECT VIEW -->
    <div class="mhc-view mhc-view--wait" data-view="wait" hidden>
      <div class="mhc-spin" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h3>Opening secure payment…</h3>
      <p>Please don't close this page. You will come back here after paying.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SUCCESS VIEW -->
    <div class="mhc-view mhc-view--ok" data-view="ok" hidden>
      <div class="mhc-ok__inner">
        <div class="mhc-burst" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <svg class="mhc-check" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="29"/><path d="M19 33l9 9 17-19"/></svg>
        <h3 class="mhc-ok__title">Order Confirmed!</h3>
        <p class="mhc-ok__no" data-mhc-okno></p>
        <div class="mhc-ok__card">
          <div><span>Product</span><b data-mhc-okprod></b></div>
          <div><span>Payment</span><b data-mhc-okpay></b></div>
          <div><span>Delivery to</span><b data-mhc-okaddr></b></div>
          <div><span>Arrives in</span><b>{{ mhc_delivery_days | escape }} &middot; FREE</b></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mhc-ok__note" data-mhc-oknote></p>
        <button type="button" class="mhc-submit mhc-submit--light" data-mhc-close>Continue shopping</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="application/json" id="mhc-data">
{
  "product": {{ product.title | json }},
  "handle": {{ product.handle | json }},
  "off": {{ mhc_prepaid_off | times: 100 }},
  "minAddr": {{ mhc_min_addr | json }},
  "minLandmark": {{ mhc_min_landmark | json }},
  "pixel": {{ mhc_pixel_id | json }},
  "gads": {{ mhc_gads_send_to | json }},
  "variant": {{ mhc_variant.id | json }},
  "variants": [{%- for v in product.variants -%}{"id": {{ v.id }}, "title": {{ v.title | json }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "available": {{ v.available | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}]
}
</script>

<style>
  .mhc,.mhc-sheet{--mhc-gold:#cca43b;--mhc-gold2:#e9cf7a;--mhc-brown:#1d1107;--mhc-brown2:#3a2211;--mhc-ink:#1a1107;--mhc-muted:#76644a;--mhc-line:#e6dcc7;--mhc-bg:#fffdf8;--mhc-ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
  .mhc{margin:.4rem 0 .2rem;display:none}
  .mhc.is-ready{display:block}
  /* only where our script is running: hide Fastrr's button, Add to cart and the old prepaid pill of THIS product form */
  .mhc-on-form .product-form__submit,.mhc-on-form .shiprocket-headless,.mhc-on-form .sr-headless-checkout,.mhc-on-form .shopify-payment-button,.mhc-on-form .prepaid-savings-pill{display:none!important}
  .mhc [hidden],.mhc-sheet [hidden]{display:none!important}

  /* ---------- page buttons ---------- */
  .mhc-btns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}
  .mhc-btn{position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:100%;min-height:6.2rem;padding:1rem 1.4rem;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.25rem;font-family:var(--font-body-family);-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;transition:transform .18s var(--mhc-ease),box-shadow .25s var(--mhc-ease);letter-spacing:.06em;touch-action:manipulation}
  .mhc-btn:active{transform:scale(.975)}
  .mhc-btn[disabled]{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;animation:none}
  .mhc-btn--cod{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--mhc-brown) 0%,var(--mhc-brown2) 100%);color:var(--mhc-gold);border:1.5px solid rgba(204,164,59,.55);box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(29,17,7,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(233,207,122,.18);animation:mhcGlow 3.2s ease-in-out infinite}
  .mhc-btn--pre{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3dc8e 0%,var(--mhc-gold) 55%,#b18a2b 100%);color:var(--mhc-ink);border:1.5px solid #b18a2b;box-shadow:0 10px 22px -10px rgba(177,138,43,.8),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.45);padding-top:2.3rem}
  .mhc-btn--pre.mhc-btn--notag{padding-top:1rem}
  .mhc-btn__row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem}
  .mhc-btn__main{font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-weight:700;font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.2}
  .mhc-btn__sub{font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:.02em;opacity:.85;font-weight:500}
  .mhc-btn--cod .mhc-btn__sub{color:#e9d9a8}
  .mhc-btn__sub s{opacity:.7}
